<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cause Serious Wounds</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Necromancer (guild level 12), Healer (guild level 28), Dark Knight (guild level 40)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cause serious wounds &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cause serious wounds</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>By praying to your god, you open serious wounds on the target with a touch. 
The better your divine power and sphere, the deeper they go. It does about as 
well against any armour, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>You need a hand free to touch with: not with a two-handed weapon, nor with a 
weapon in one hand and a shield or something held in the other. Casting it 
is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Harm</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>